      "filename": "Cobh - The Last Port Of Call For The Titanic (7163992437).jpg",
      "title": "File:Cobh - The Last Port Of Call For The Titanic (7163992437).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/Cobh_-_The_Last_Port_Of_Call_For_The_Titanic_%287163992437%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cobh_-_The_Last_Port_Of_Call_For_The_Titanic_(7163992437).jpg",
      "width": 6000,
      "height": 4000,
